<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>LSM ReproChecker — Reproducibility of Automated Landslide Mapping Methods</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="static/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="site-header__inner">
      <div class="site-header__text">
        <span class="site-header__eyebrow">LSM ReproChecker</span>
        <h1 class="site-header__title">Landslide mapping reproducibility assessments</h1>
        <p class="site-header__subtitle">
          Automated landslide mapping publications, from 2020 to 2025, retrieved from Scopus,
          assessed for whether the code and data needed to reproduce their results are
          available. All publications with available code to replicate their mapping methods
          are marked as reproducible or partially reproducible.
        </p>
      </div>
      <figure class="site-header__cover">
        <div class="frame">
          <img src="static/cover.png" alt="Encoder-decoder segmentation pipeline: a satellite image of a landslide processed into a predicted landslide mask">
        </div>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <div class="site-header__ramp" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </header>

  <div class="page">

    <div class="controls">
      <input
        id="search-input"
        class="search-input"
        type="search"
        placeholder="Search by title, author, dataset, or method…"
        autocomplete="off"
      >
      <span id="result-count" class="result-count"></span>
    </div>

    <div id="status-filter" class="filter-row" aria-label="Filter by reproducibility status"></div>
    <div id="approach-filter" class="filter-row" aria-label="Filter by method approach"></div>

    <main id="card-grid" class="card-grid"></main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      © 2026 Built by Flávio H. R. Fonseca. This project was developed using LSM_ReproChecker, available at <a
        href=https://github.com/fhrochaf/LSM_ReproChecker>github.com/fhrochaf/LSM_ReproChecker</a>.
    </footer>
  </div>

  <div id="modal-backdrop" class="modal-backdrop">
    <div class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
      <button id="modal-close" class="modal__close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
      <div id="modal-body"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script id="papers-data" type="application/json">{{ papers_json|safe }}</script>
  <script src="static/script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
